  <completion>Done 2026-11-27: PR #3288 squash-merged to master (fae8f453d6; #1767, #1663; D-230) after an independent Opus adversarial review (no F-class) and an ebilling-r1 review with one fix round (money compared at half a unit of the record currency's precision, strict tolerance). A spend, budget or utilization Threshold Signal created on a matter or project recalculates that one record's roll-up through FinanceRollupService once per pass; FinanceRollupService skips a write whose stored values already match. Known limits: a failed recalculation is logged and not retried; Signals already open at deploy are not recalculated (a one-off recalculate-route call needs an owner go). On dev with the uac-r2 dev BFF deploy of 5cd40984b0 (2026-11-27, master 765a199922).</completion>
